INSERT INTO `faqs` VALUES (1,'Period Panties','How long can I wear an AFOREHEALTH Period Panty before changing?','On normal to heavy flow days, our UltraDry 4-layer period panty can be worn safely for 8 to 12 hours. For extraordinarily heavy flows, you can wear it as a backup alongside a menstrual cup or pad, or carry a fresh pair in our waterproof travel pouch.',0,'active'),(2,'Period Panties','Will it smell or feel wet like a sanitary pad?','No! Unlike plastic disposable pads that trap moisture and encourage bacteria growth (which causes period odor), our breathable organic cotton top layer wicks fluid into the absorbent core in under 3 seconds, keeping you dry and completely odor-free.',0,'active'),(3,'Care & Washing','How do I wash AFOREHEALTH period panties properly?','Step 1: Rinse under cold tap water until the water runs clear. Step 2: Wash in cold water by hand or on a gentle machine cycle with mild detergent. Step 3: Hang to dry in the shade. Never use hot water, bleach, or fabric softener as they can damage the leakproof membrane.',0,'active'),(4,'Sizing & Fit','How do I know what size to order?','Refer to our interactive Size Chart on each product page. Measure the widest part of your hips using a measuring tape. If you are between two sizes or have wider hips/thighs, we recommend picking the larger size.',0,'active'),(5,'Shipping & Discretion','Is the packaging discreet? Will delivery personnel know what is inside?','100% Yes! All AFOREHEALTH orders are shipped in plain, tamper-evident courier polybags or unmarked brown boxes. There is zero mention of intimate apparel, period wear, or internal product names on the outer delivery label.',0,'active'),(6,'Shipping & Discretion','What are the delivery timelines and shipping charges across India?','We offer FREE Shipping on all prepaid and COD orders above ₹499. For orders below ₹499, a nominal flat shipping fee of ₹50 is applied. Metro deliveries take 2-3 business days, while other cities receive orders in 3-5 business days.',0,'active'),(7,'Returns & Hygiene','Can I return or exchange intimate wear products?','Due to strict intimate hygiene guidelines for women health, products that have been unsealed, worn, or washed cannot be returned. However, if you receive a damaged item or an unopened product with a sizing issue, we offer a hassle-free 7-day exchange window.',0,'active'),(8,'Payments & COD','Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?','Yes! We support Cash on Delivery for orders between ₹299 and ₹5000 across 25,000+ Indian PIN codes. We also accept Razorpay, UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), credit/debit cards, and Net Banking.',0,'active'),(9,'Intimate Care','Can I use the Intimate Foam Wash during my period?','Yes, absolutely! The pH 3.8 gentle foam wash is ideal during menstruation to cleanse dried blood and soothe vaginal irritation. Always wash the external vulva only (never douche internally).',0,'active'),(10,'Wholesale & Combos','Do you offer bulk discounts or gift sets?','Yes! Our Combos & Value Packs offer up to 35% savings over purchasing individual items, and we provide curated gift hampers like the First Period Box for teens.',0,'active');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `faqs` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

