INSERT INTO `reviews` VALUES (1,1,1,NULL,5,'Absolute life saver! Zero stains on white sheets','I was very skeptical about period panties for my heavy Day 2 flow. I wore this overnight and woke up with dry sheets and no weird pad odor. Washing was super simple under cold water. Totally hooked and ordered two more pairs!','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(2,1,2,NULL,5,'Best investment for Indian women','The fabric feels so luxurious against the skin compared to synthetic pads that gave me horrible chafing rashes every month. Truly leakproof and comfortable!','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(3,1,3,NULL,5,'Gynecologist approved comfort','As a healthcare worker doing 14 hour shifts, frequent pad changes were a nightmare. This panty gave me total peace of mind throughout my hospital rounds.','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(4,2,4,NULL,5,'Sleep in any posture with zero fear','The back coverage goes all the way up. No side leaks even when tossing and turning. Super soft modal waist band that does not pinch.','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(5,11,1,NULL,5,'Unbelievable buttery softness','These are softer than anything I have bought from international brands. Pure comfort, zero wedgies and no panty lines.','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(6,29,2,NULL,5,'Gentle and soothing, no burning sensation','Most washes have harsh artificial perfume. This tea tree & chamomile foam has a very subtle natural clean scent and soothes itching immediately.','approved','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27'),(7,1,5,NULL,4,'Great absorbency, wish there were more color options','Worked wonderfully during heavy cycle. Would love to see pastel blue and lavender colors launched soon!','pending','2026-10-16 19:03:27','2026-10-16 19:03:27');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `reviews` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

